{"id":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","revision":0,"last_node_id":159,"last_link_id":402,"nodes":[{"id":116,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-3623.9999999999977,4208.571414184571],"size":[620,980],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Note: GPT_av2av_1person 使用说明","properties":{},"widgets_values":["## GPT_av2av_1person — 原视频 + 三视图 -> 完整人物替换\n\n### 输入\n1. 节点 150 `Load Video`：原始视频。\n2. 节点 153 `Load Image`：替换角色三视图（正面 / 侧面 / 背面拼成一张）。\n\n### 本版关键变化\n- 原视频不再仅作为普通 `ref_video_0` 参考；改为接入 `MiniMaxH3AddGuide`，使用 H3 Guide Conditioning。\n- 节点 145 加载专用 `minimax_h3_character_swap_v1.1_ref2va_fro.safetensors`。\n- 节点 159 再加载官方配套 `minimax_h3_dmd_ref2va_8step_turbo_pruned.safetensors`。\n- 使用官方 v1.1 路线的 8-step DMD 采样配置。\n- Prompt 改为专用 `body_swap:` 模板，明确要求替换整个人物（脸、头发、身体、四肢和服装）。\n- 原始音频仍直接连接到 `Create Video`，不从模型生成音频。\n\n### 必须准备的模型\n将以下两个文件放入 `ComfyUI/models/loras/`，并确认节点 145、159 选中正确文件：\n1. `minimax_h3_character_swap_v1.1_ref2va_fro.safetensors`（约 80 MB，强度 1.0）\n2. `minimax_h3_dmd_ref2va_8step_turbo_pruned.safetensors`（官方 v1.1 工作流配套 8-step DMD LoRA，强度 1.0）\n\n### 三视图参考图\n角色三视图建议先去除绿色背景，改为透明背景或中性灰背景；不要让绿色幕布成为角色参考的一部分。三视图应清楚展示同一个角色的正面、侧面和背面，尽量避免文字、边框和多余留白。\n\n### 重要说明\n- 这是专用 Character Swap LoRA + Guide Latent 路线，不是上一版单纯加长 Prompt。\n- 先用 3–5 秒片段测试脸部和衣服是否确实变化，再处理长视频。\n- 这是生成式视频重绘，不能承诺逐像素锁定背景或每一帧百分之百无残留；如果人物替换成功但背景发生变化，下一阶段再加入分割/背景合成。\n"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"## GPT_av2av_1person — 原视频 + 三视图 -> 完整人物替换\n\n### 输入\n1. 节点 150 `Load Video`：原始视频。\n2. 节点 153 `Load Image`：替换角色三视图（正面 / 侧面 / 背面拼成一张）。\n\n### 本版关键变化\n- 原视频不再仅作为普通 `ref_video_0` 参考；改为接入 `MiniMaxH3AddGuide`，使用 H3 Guide Conditioning。\n- 节点 145 加载专用 `minimax_h3_character_swap_v1.1_ref2va_fro.safetensors`。\n- 节点 159 再加载官方配套 `minimax_h3_dmd_ref2va_8step_turbo_pruned.safetensors`。\n- 使用官方 v1.1 路线的 8-step DMD 采样配置。\n- Prompt 改为专用 `body_swap:` 模板，明确要求替换整个人物（脸、头发、身体、四肢和服装）。\n- 原始音频仍直接连接到 `Create Video`，不从模型生成音频。\n\n### 必须准备的模型\n将以下两个文件放入 `ComfyUI/models/loras/`，并确认节点 145、159 选中正确文件：\n1. `minimax_h3_character_swap_v1.1_ref2va_fro.safetensors`（约 80 MB，强度 1.0）\n2. `minimax_h3_dmd_ref2va_8step_turbo_pruned.safetensors`（官方 v1.1 工作流配套 8-step DMD LoRA，强度 1.0）\n\n### 三视图参考图\n角色三视图建议先去除绿色背景，改为透明背景或中性灰背景；不要让绿色幕布成为角色参考的一部分。三视图应清楚展示同一个角色的正面、侧面和背面，尽量避免文字、边框和多余留白。\n\n### 重要说明\n- 这是专用 Character Swap LoRA + Guide Latent 路线，不是上一版单纯加长 Prompt。\n- 先用 3–5 秒片段测试脸部和衣服是否确实变化，再处理长视频。\n- 这是生成式视频重绘，不能承诺逐像素锁定背景或每一帧百分之百无残留；如果人物替换成功但背景发生变化，下一阶段再加入分割/背景合成。\n"},"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":138,"type":"PrimitiveStringMultiline","pos":[-1673.8987223120805,4232.898776214687],"size":[762.5102676374652,778.6439769564467],"flags":{},"order":1,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"值","name":"value","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"value"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"字符串","name":"STRING","type":"STRING","links":[279]}],"title":"Input Text (Prompt)","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"PrimitiveStringMultiline"},"widgets_values":["body_swap: subject_definitions: <Subject 1> is the exact character shown in <Picture 1>, whose face, facial structure, head, hairstyle, hair color, skin appearance, body shape, body proportions, and complete outfit define the replacement character. The guide video provides the original scene and performance frame by frame: its background, environment, lighting, camera, framing, perspective, body pose, hand and arm movement, head rotation, gaze direction, and complete action timing. Only the main performer in the guide video is replaced: the original performer's face, hair, head, body, arms, hands, legs, feet, and clothing become <Subject 1>. summary: [video generation + reference] Replace the guide performer completely with <Subject 1>, keeping the original scene, camera, framing, and complete motion and performance of the guide video. detailed_description: [Shot 1] <Subject 1> occupies the exact screen position and performs the same actions as the guide performer, with identical timing, body poses, gestures, head motion, and movement amplitude. The replacement must use the face, hair, body design, proportions, and clothing from <Picture 1> throughout the entire clip. No part of the original performer's face, hair, body, hands, legs, or clothing may remain visible. There is only one performer: <Subject 1>. The background, props, lighting, colors, perspective, and camera movement of the guide video are preserved. Prevent identity drift, original-face leakage, original-clothing leakage, hybrid identity, clothing changes, texture crawling, double silhouettes, and flicker. The green background and layout of the character reference sheet are not part of the scene."],"widgets_values_named":{"value":"body_swap: subject_definitions: <Subject 1> is the exact character shown in <Picture 1>, whose face, facial structure, head, hairstyle, hair color, skin appearance, body shape, body proportions, and complete outfit define the replacement character. The guide video provides the original scene and performance frame by frame: its background, environment, lighting, camera, framing, perspective, body pose, hand and arm movement, head rotation, gaze direction, and complete action timing. Only the main performer in the guide video is replaced: the original performer's face, hair, head, body, arms, hands, legs, feet, and clothing become <Subject 1>. summary: [video generation + reference] Replace the guide performer completely with <Subject 1>, keeping the original scene, camera, framing, and complete motion and performance of the guide video. detailed_description: [Shot 1] <Subject 1> occupies the exact screen position and performs the same actions as the guide performer, with identical timing, body poses, gestures, head motion, and movement amplitude. The replacement must use the face, hair, body design, proportions, and clothing from <Picture 1> throughout the entire clip. No part of the original performer's face, hair, body, hands, legs, or clothing may remain visible. There is only one performer: <Subject 1>. The background, props, lighting, colors, perspective, and camera movement of the guide video are preserved. Prevent identity drift, original-face leakage, original-clothing leakage, hybrid identity, clothing changes, texture crawling, double silhouettes, and flicker. The green background and layout of the character reference sheet are not part of the scene."}},{"id":150,"type":"LoadVideo","pos":[-2709.826602252652,5154.903085854905],"size":[340,692.1818181818181],"flags":{},"order":2,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"文件","name":"file","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"file"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"选择要上传的文件","name":"upload","type":"IMAGEUPLOAD","widget":{"name":"upload"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"视频","name":"VIDEO","type":"VIDEO","links":[285]}],"title":"Load Video (原视频 -> <Video 1>)","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"LoadVideo"},"widgets_values":["","image"],"widgets_values_named":{"file":"","upload":"image"},"color":"#322","bgcolor":"#533"},{"id":151,"type":"Video Slice","pos":[-2333.474949981659,5551.949343017237],"size":[290,140],"flags":{},"order":14,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"视频","name":"video","type":"VIDEO","link":285},{"localized_name":"起始时间","name":"start_time","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"start_time"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"时长","name":"duration","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"duration"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"严格时长","name":"strict_duration","type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"strict_duration"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"视频","name":"VIDEO","type":"VIDEO","links":[286]}],"title":"Trim Video (与输出等长)","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"Video Slice"},"widgets_values":[0,0,false],"widgets_values_named":{"start_time":0,"duration":0,"strict_duration":false}},{"id":152,"type":"GetVideoComponents","pos":[-2332.482631757432,5740.644908999103],"size":[316.605078125,140],"flags":{},"order":17,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"视频","name":"video","type":"VIDEO","link":286}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"图像","n